    "long_instructions": "##Finalize\r\n###What to do:\r\nRefine your app and get it ready to share. Focus on making your design clear, your code clean, and your reflection thoughtful. This is your chance to polish, test, and document your work.\r\n\r\n**Focus on:**\r\n- Cleaning up code and adding helpful comments.\r\n- Checking that your logic and visuals match your goals.\r\n- Writing your reflection and identifying future enhancements.\r\n- Save versions as needed.\r\n\r\n**Ask AI for help when reviewing.** Possible Stems:\r\n- Can you help me review my code for clarity or repetition?\r\n- How can I make this section of my app more user-friendly?\r\n\r\n###Your goal:\r\nA polished, fully functional interactive app that shows your logic, design, and creativity.",
